S7  T5 -- clustering and flows ('the dark energy sweeps galaxies together')
==============================================================================================================
  (a) A uniform one-direction front v = v_f n-hat has div v = 0 identically: it displaces everything together and makes no
      overdensity grow. Sweeping galaxies together needs div v < 0 on overdensities, i.e. a sink (door 11A).
      <repo>/campaign_fresh_gravity/CFG171_door11A_inflow/cfg171_s3_gates_results.json -> 11A's literal medium carries 15.8-205 x the baryons' orbital energy
